WEBVTT

00:01:19.557 --> 00:01:21.559
[THUNDER CRACKING]

00:01:54.418 --> 00:01:56.072
Welcome! Welcome!

00:01:56.246 --> 00:01:57.421
Congrats, Drac.

00:01:57.595 --> 00:02:00.772
Holy smokes,
everybody's here.

00:02:00.946 --> 00:02:03.210
Mr. and Mrs. Loughran,
the parents of the groom,
and family.

00:02:03.384 --> 00:02:04.385
[CHUCKLING]

00:02:08.693 --> 00:02:10.086
Mom and Dad! Johnny!

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:11.914
I can't believe
you're all here.

00:02:18.094 --> 00:02:18.921
[GIGGLING]

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:30.367
[ALL EXCLAIMING]

00:02:34.284 --> 00:02:35.764
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah!
[CHUCKLING]

00:02:36.982 --> 00:02:38.897
Yo, how hot is my date?

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:40.769
GRIFFIN: So hot. Wow.

00:02:40.943 --> 00:02:42.162
How 'bout how hot mine is?

00:02:42.336 --> 00:02:44.164
You got a date?

00:02:44.338 --> 00:02:47.341
Yeah. She's invisible.
That's why you can't see her.

00:02:47.515 --> 00:02:48.603
Oh, right. This is
the one from "Canada"?

00:02:48.777 --> 00:02:50.039
[GRIFFIN SHUSHES]

00:02:50.213 --> 00:02:51.214
Wedding's starting.

00:03:00.267 --> 00:03:01.268
Ah!

00:03:05.228 --> 00:03:06.229
ALL: Oh!

00:03:09.928 --> 00:03:10.799
ALL: Aw!

00:03:48.184 --> 00:03:49.620
[LAUGHING] Whoo-hoo!

00:03:50.665 --> 00:03:51.448
Great.

00:03:53.102 --> 00:03:53.668
[SPEAKING GIBBERISH]

00:03:59.413 --> 00:04:01.589
True. So true, Marty.

00:04:01.763 --> 00:04:02.938
ALL: Aw!

00:04:04.505 --> 00:04:05.767
[SCREAMING] [CAMERAS CLICKING]

00:04:15.951 --> 00:04:16.778
[MR. BIGFOOT BELLOWING]

00:04:16.952 --> 00:04:18.345
Aw. How sweet.

00:04:21.391 --> 00:04:23.001
Oh, my. Look at you. [GASPS]

00:04:24.612 --> 00:04:25.526
[MUFFLED VOICE] Oh, my gosh.

00:04:26.875 --> 00:04:27.702
Oh.

00:04:31.923 --> 00:04:32.620
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:43.195
Is it everything you wanted,
my little poisonberry?

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.762
Oh, it is, Daddy.

00:04:45.676 --> 00:04:47.765
Except where's Grandpa Vlad?

00:04:47.939 --> 00:04:50.290
Honey, your gramps
would not have
been cool with this.

00:04:50.464 --> 00:04:52.161
He's old-school.

00:04:52.335 --> 00:04:54.511
How do we know?
If he could
just meet Johnny...

00:04:54.685 --> 00:04:56.296
He would have eaten him.

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:59.255
He's not as
enlightened as your hip Daddy.

00:04:59.429 --> 00:05:02.737
So, you're really okay
with him not being a monster?

00:05:02.911 --> 00:05:06.784
Human, monster, unicorn,
as long as you're happy.

00:05:08.003 --> 00:05:09.047
Thanks, Dad.

00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:15.445
♪ And you'll always
be my moonlight

00:05:15.619 --> 00:05:18.970
♪ But now on
wings of love you soar

00:05:19.144 --> 00:05:21.582
♪ Now that
you're Johnny's girl

00:05:22.278 --> 00:05:23.323
♪ Johnny's girl

00:05:23.497 --> 00:05:25.760
♪ And kind of Daddy's, too

00:05:25.934 --> 00:05:27.631
♪ Your mom would be so happy

00:05:27.805 --> 00:05:30.068
♪ 'Cause she always knew

00:05:30.242 --> 00:05:35.204
♪ Love is making room
for all the best in you ♪

00:05:35.378 --> 00:05:36.118
[APPLAUDING]

00:05:39.251 --> 00:05:40.775
[MR. BIGFOOT CRYING]

00:05:51.089 --> 00:05:51.829
[HUMMING]

00:05:54.615 --> 00:05:55.703
Hey, Dad.

00:05:55.877 --> 00:05:56.878
Oh, hey, guys!

00:05:57.052 --> 00:05:58.445
Todd, take a break.

00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:04.276
So, what's up?

00:06:04.451 --> 00:06:07.279
Mavis was wondering
if maybe you
wanted to go for a fly.

00:06:07.454 --> 00:06:11.501
Oh. We haven't
done that in forever.
Any special reason?

00:06:11.675 --> 00:06:13.155
No special reason at all.
[GIGGLES]

00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:15.418
Right, Mavey? [CHUCKLES]

00:06:16.245 --> 00:06:17.246
What's his deal?

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.682
He's silly.

00:06:18.856 --> 00:06:20.641
It's just
a beautiful night, and...

00:06:20.815 --> 00:06:22.382
Well, if you don't want to...

00:06:22.556 --> 00:06:23.948
No, no! Are you kidding?

00:06:24.122 --> 00:06:26.560
I would eat a bucket of
garlic to fly with you.

